{"id":"8704f7cdcca763f9","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-weakasummable.md","title":"Weak asummability and Chow functions","display":"df-weakasummable — Weak asummability and Chow functions","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-weakasummable","aliases":["27-df-weakasummable"],"display":"df-weakasummable — Weak asummability and Chow functions","depends_on":["[[27-df-truefalse]]","[[27-df-chow]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§9.6.1 Definitions 9.6 and 9.7","source_printed_pages":"429","source_pdf_pages":"453","verification_status":"source-definition-checked-distinct-points","local_review_status":"2026-10-20-formalization-reviewed-source-text-not-rechecked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-weakasummable"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-weakasummable</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-weakasummable — Weak asummability and Chow functions"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"98e5c19fe4a2b9e2\" href=\"?note=98e5c19fe4a2b9e2\" title=\"27-df-truefalse\">27-df-truefalse</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"260aad3bc2408854\" href=\"?note=260aad3bc2408854\" title=\"27-df-chow\">27-df-chow</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§9.6.1 Definitions 9.6 and 9.7"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"429"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"453"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-definition-checked-distinct-points"},{"key":"local_review_status","html":"2026-10-20-formalization-reviewed-source-text-not-rechecked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n,T(f),F(f)\">\\(\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n,T(f),F(f)\\)</span> 来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"98e5c19fe4a2b9e2\" href=\"?note=98e5c19fe4a2b9e2\" title=\"27-df-truefalse\">27-df-truefalse</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Chow}\">\\(\\mathrm{Chow}\\)</span> 来自 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"260aad3bc2408854\" href=\"?note=260aad3bc2408854\" title=\"27-df-chow\">27-df-chow</a>。</li>\n<li>对有限集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^r\">\\(A^r\\)</span> 允许重复；下式用额外的两两不等条件排除重复。引入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WeakAsummable}_n,\\mathrm{ChowFunc}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{WeakAsummable}_n,\\mathrm{ChowFunc}_n\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WeakAsummable}_n\\coloneqq\\left\\{f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\ \\middle|\\ \\neg\\exists r\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists(x_1,\\ldots,x_r)\\in T(f)^r\\;\\exists(y_1,\\ldots,y_r)\\in F(f)^r\\;\\left[\\left(\\forall i\\in[n]\\;\\left(\\sum_{j=1}^r(x_j)_i=\\sum_{j=1}^r(y_j)_i\\right)\\right)\\land\\forall a,b\\in\\{1,\\ldots,r\\}\\;\\left(a\\neq b\\longrightarrow(x_a\\neq x_b\\land y_a\\neq y_b)\\right)\\right]\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{WeakAsummable}_n\\coloneqq\\left\\{f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\ \\middle|\\ \\neg\\exists r\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists(x_1,\\ldots,x_r)\\in T(f)^r\\;\\exists(y_1,\\ldots,y_r)\\in F(f)^r\\;\\left[\\left(\\forall i\\in[n]\\;\\left(\\sum_{j=1}^r(x_j)_i=\\sum_{j=1}^r(y_j)_i\\right)\\right)\\land\\forall a,b\\in\\{1,\\ldots,r\\}\\;\\left(a\\neq b\\longrightarrow(x_a\\neq x_b\\land y_a\\neq y_b)\\right)\\right]\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ChowFunc}_n\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\mid\\forall g\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\;(\\mathrm{Chow}(g)=\\mathrm{Chow}(f)\\longrightarrow g=f)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ChowFunc}_n\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\mid\\forall g\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\;(\\mathrm{Chow}(g)=\\mathrm{Chow}(f)\\longrightarrow g=f)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>原书 §9.6.1，Definitions 9.6、9.7，印刷 p.429／PDF p.453；已核对定义。weak asummability 要求同侧所选点互异；普通 asummability 允许重复，此差别不可省去。</li>\n<li>两侧本来属于互斥的真假点集合，故不必另写跨侧互异条件。量词 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\\geq1\">\\(r\\geq1\\)</span> 在本文件始终取自然数。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-truefalse","status":"resolved","id":"98e5c19fe4a2b9e2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-truefalse]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-chow","status":"resolved","id":"260aad3bc2408854","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-chow]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-truefalse","status":"resolved","id":"98e5c19fe4a2b9e2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n,T(f),F(f)$ 来自 [[27-df-truefalse]]，$\\mathrm{Chow}$ 来自 [[27-df-chow]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-chow","status":"resolved","id":"260aad3bc2408854","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n,T(f),F(f)$ 来自 [[27-df-truefalse]]，$\\mathrm{Chow}$ 来自 [[27-df-chow]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n,T(f),F(f)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Chow}","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"A^r","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WeakAsummable}_n,\\mathrm{ChowFunc}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{WeakAsummable}_n\\coloneqq\\left\\{f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\ \\middle|\\ \\neg\\exists r\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\exists(x_1,\\ldots,x_r)\\in T(f)^r\\;\\exists(y_1,\\ldots,y_r)\\in F(f)^r\\;\\left[\\left(\\forall i\\in[n]\\;\\left(\\sum_{j=1}^r(x_j)_i=\\sum_{j=1}^r(y_j)_i\\right)\\right)\\land\\forall a,b\\in\\{1,\\ldots,r\\}\\;\\left(a\\neq b\\longrightarrow(x_a\\neq x_b\\land y_a\\neq y_b)\\right)\\right]\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ChowFunc}_n\\coloneqq\\{f\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\mid\\forall g\\in\\mathrm{BoolFunc}_n\\;(\\mathrm{Chow}(g)=\\mathrm{Chow}(f)\\longrightarrow g=f)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"r\\geq1","display":false}],"bytes":2011,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-365","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-weakasummable|df-weakasummable — Weak asummability and Chow functions]]"},{"id":"48ace877e95f08e6","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$；$\\mathrm{WeakAsummable}_n,\\mathrm{ChowFunc}_n$ 见 [[27-df-weakasummable]]，$\\mathrm{Threshold}_n$ 见 [[27-df-threshold]]，阈值唯一性见 [[27-thm-chowuniq]]。"}],"outgoing":["98e5c19fe4a2b9e2","260aad3bc2408854"]}